# Design notes — Heist 64×48 display choice

Operator-facing help stays short (tick 64×48 on Club Public Profile / Master Admin). Implementation detail lives here:

- Firestore: `clubLocations/heist-washington-dc` → `VenueSupports64x48=1` (keep `VenueSupports64x32` if that board stays live).
- Optional primary: `primaryDisplayScreenFormatId=led-64x48` only when that board is Xibo Display 1.
- Xibo URL: `display.html?location=heist-washington-dc` only — never `?screen=` or `?v=`.
- Packaged catalog may list `led-64x48`; **Firestore `VenueSupports*` flags win** when set.

See also `screen-datapoints.mdc`.
